{"adjacent_source_text": "", "formulas": [{"evidence_span": {"bbox": [248.816, 386.819, 531.7, 398.573], "line_ids": ["122556d2aee267f3"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "f1620fec0068a9ce", "text": "L = Ax3 + Bx2 + Cx + D （B.1）"}, "expression_lines": ["L = Ax3 + Bx2 + Cx + D （B.1）"], "expression_text": "L = Ax3 + Bx2 + Cx + D （B.1）", "formula_number": "B.1"}, {"evidence_span": {"bbox": [278.114, 406.292, 531.7, 418.046], "line_ids": ["fe116f426f95d5c8"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "b64ed9b7ba5c122f", "text": "L = A + Bxc （B.2）"}, "expression_lines": ["L = A + Bxc （B.2）"], "expression_text": "L = A + Bxc （B.2）", "formula_number": "B.2"}, {"evidence_span": {"bbox": [255.498, 424.559, 531.7, 435.956], "line_ids": ["417443ef9343ef57"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "fe3c8382c981b29b", "text": "L = −1/ 2Aln(1− x) （B.3）"}, "expression_lines": ["L = −1/ 2Aln(1− x) （B.3）"], "expression_text": "L = −1/ 2Aln(1− x) （B.3）", "formula_number": "B.3"}], "interstitial_text": "", "introduction": "传输模型的遥感反演方法。（1）统计法经验模型法是常用的统计方法，该方法是用植被指数估算叶面积指数，一般过程是建立植被指数和叶面积指数的经验关系，并使用观测数据进行拟合，再使用拟合好的模型估算叶面积指数，常用表达叶面积指数和植被指数的经验关系主要有以下几种形式：", "provenance": {"document_title": "生态系统质量评估", "evidence_spans": [{"bbox": [63.864, 304.659, 531.805, 487.631], "line_ids": ["63b9a1bcb4dade23", "f6117470db543bf4", "d86be1a0628e87e4", "4ed668d582b2134a", "109cfd73ea0d50bc", "122556d2aee267f3", "fe116f426f95d5c8", "417443ef9343ef57", "960dc6f33eda5677", "4bcdca992dcb75ef", "d4be93ec158a9c78"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "52b3de18fb8317f1", "text": "传输模型的遥感反演方法。\n（1）统计法\n经验模型法是常用的统计方法，该方法是用植被指数估算叶面积指数，一般过程是建立植被指数和\n叶面积指数的经验关系，并使用观测数据进行拟合，再使用拟合好的模型估算叶面积指数，常用表达叶\n面积指数和植被指数的经验关系主要有以下几种形式：\nL = Ax3 + Bx2 + Cx + D （B.1）\nL = A + Bxc （B.2）\nL = −1/ 2Aln(1− x) （B.3）\n式中：L——叶面积指数；\nx ——从遥感数据获取的植被指数或反射率；\nA、B、C 和 D ——经验参数，随着植被类型变化。"}], "heading_chain": ["附录 B", "B.1 叶面积指数（LAI）"], "pages": [8], "printed_pages": ["5"], "section": "B.1", "source_file": "..\\全国生态状况调查评估技术规范\\2.全国生态状况调查评估技术规范—生态系统质量评估.pdf", "source_sha256": "9b284267408b8080337bb8185594aa443d2e97663e3f6f69d8b9f8c4df42d5e0", "standard_code": "HJ 1172-2021"}, "schema_version": "source-unit-v2.0", "unit_id": "3194374504e7f58a", "unit_type": "formula_package", "variable_definitions": [{"definition": "叶面积指数；", "evidence_span": {"bbox": [63.864, 445.079, 183.388, 456.431], "line_ids": ["960dc6f33eda5677"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "22661664e779fc3d", "text": "式中：L——叶面积指数；"}, "symbol": "L", "unit": ""}, {"definition": "从遥感数据获取的植被指数或反射率；", "evidence_span": {"bbox": [97.382, 460.679, 301.731, 471.797], "line_ids": ["4bcdca992dcb75ef"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "a03da97bd20f85a5", "text": "x ——从遥感数据获取的植被指数或反射率；"}, "symbol": "x", "unit": ""}, {"definition": "经验参数，随着植被类型变化。", "evidence_span": {"bbox": [95.064, 476.279, 328.003, 487.631], "line_ids": ["d4be93ec158a9c78"], "page": 8, "printed_page": "5", "span_id": "152371b40e9ebfa9", "text": "A、B、C 和 D ——经验参数，随着植被类型变化。"}, "symbol": "A、B、C和D", "unit": ""}]}
